@startgantt proposal-schedule
title Planned schedule (weeks from the start of the project)
printscale weekly
hide footbox

-- Analysis --
[Requirements and market study] as [A1] requires 2 weeks
[Architecture and data model] as [A2] requires 2 weeks
[A2] starts at [A1]'s end

-- SQL foundation --
[Connection pool, transactions, migrations] as [B1] requires 1 week
[B1] starts at [A2]'s end
[Move every controller store to SQL] as [B2] requires 3 weeks
[B2] starts at [B1]'s end

-- Commerce --
[Accounts, catalogue and wallet ledger] as [C1] requires 2 weeks
[C1] starts at [B1]'s end
[Orders, provisioning, billing and invoices] as [C2] requires 2 weeks
[C2] starts at [C1]'s end

-- Front ends --
[Storefront (English and Persian)] as [D1] requires 2 weeks
[D1] starts at [C2]'s end
[Administration Sales area] as [D2] requires 2 weeks
[D2] starts at [C2]'s end

-- Verification and documentation --
[Automated tests on MariaDB and MySQL] as [E1] requires 2 weeks
[E1] starts at [B2]'s end
[End-to-end verification] as [E2] requires 1 week
[E2] starts at [D1]'s end
[Documentation] as [E3] requires 2 weeks
[E3] starts at [E2]'s end

[Submission] happens at [E3]'s end
@endgantt
